Implement asynchronous processing for long recordings.

## Document generation

Use suitable libraries for:
- PDF generation.
- Microsoft Word DOCX generation.
- Editable rich-text documents.

Recommended editor: TipTap or an equivalent rich-text editor.

Preserve formatting when exporting documents.

## Deployment

Make the application compatible with:
- Vercel or another suitable Next.js hosting provider.
- Supabase hosting services for database and storage.
- Custom domains.
- HTTPS.
- Production environment variables.

